    <bpmn:process id="W_W5081" name="W5081. Reprographics Service Strategy, Catalog &amp; Business-Model Design" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy refresh (VS-33); B2B/trade-pro program (VS-43); new service launch
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: 1 program across selected high-trade-density stores
Owner: Director, Store Services / Trade Pro &amp; Services (VS-43)
Participants: Strategy (VS-33), Trade Pro (VS-43), Merchandising (VS-01), Marketing (VS-14), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Legal/Compliance (VS-100/VS-91), IT (VS-27)
Source: workflow W5081 — Reprographics Service Strategy, Catalog &amp; Business-Model Design</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5081_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5081_Lane1" name="Director Store Services">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5081_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5081_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5081_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5081_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5081_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5081_Start3" name="Strategy refresh (VS-33); B2B/trade-pro program (VS-43); new service launch">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5081_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5081_Task4" name="Set the reprographics strategy &amp; catalog: the service catalog (large-format…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the reprographics strategy &amp; catalog: the service catalog (large-format plan print/scan/copy, bid-set/plan-room, binding/folding, archiving), the rollout (which high-trade-density stores), the make-vs-partner/3PL model, and the KPIs (job volume, margin, attach, uptime)
Responsible (R): Director Store Services / Trade Pro / Strategy
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5081_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5081_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5081_Task5" name="Build the business case: equipment capex, consumables cost, breakeven job…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Build the business case: equipment capex, consumables cost, breakeven job volume, payback, and the trade-pro-traffic/attach linkage to B2B revenue (links VS-11/VS-43) with FP&amp;A
Responsible (R): Director Store Services / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Director Store Services / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5081_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5081_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5081_Task6" name="Govern &amp; approve: leadership sign-off (VS-36), the legal/compliance posture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern &amp; approve: leadership sign-off (VS-36), the legal/compliance posture (copyright/IP, RA 10173 document confidentiality — W5087), and the entity placement with Legal/Compliance
Responsible (R): Director Store Services / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): Director Store Services / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5081_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5081_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5081_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5081_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5081_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-758 (ensure controlled execution — Reprographics Service Strategy, Equipment &amp; Catalog Setup (PA-176.1).) | - CTL-758: business case leadership-approved (VS-36); legal/privacy posture defined (VS-100/VS-91); economics FP&amp;A-validated
Owner: Director, Store Services / Trade Pro &amp; Services (VS-43)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5081_Assoc9" sourceRef="W5081_Annotation8" targetRef="W5081_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
