    <bpmn:process id="W_W5083" name="W5083. Reprographics Pricing, Cost-per-SQM &amp; Service Tariff Strategy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Service launch (W5081); cost change; pricing review
Frequency: At launch + periodic review
Volume: ~20–30 tariff lines per service (print/scan/copy/binding/archiving) × media type
Owner: Pricing (VS-01.2) / Director Store Services
Participants: Pricing (VS-01.2), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Trade Pro (VS-43), Marketing (VS-14), Compliance (price-integrity VS-118)
Source: workflow W5083 — Reprographics Pricing, Cost-per-SQM &amp; Service Tariff Strategy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5083_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5083_Lane1" name="Pricing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5083_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5083_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5083_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5083_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5083_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5083_Start3" name="Service launch (W5081); cost change; pricing review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5083_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5083_Task4" name="Set the tariff &amp; cost model: cost-per-sqm (media + ink + machine + labor +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the tariff &amp; cost model: cost-per-sqm (media + ink + machine + labor + overhead), tariff by service (print/scan/copy/binding/archiving), media-type/size tiers, and volume/bulk-account discounting
Responsible (R): Pricing / FP&amp;A / Director Store Services
Accountable (A): Director Store Services / Pricing Director
Duration: At launch + review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5083_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5083_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5083_Task5" name="Ensure price integrity &amp; disclosure: all-in price disclosure (RA 7394)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ensure price integrity &amp; disclosure: all-in price disclosure (RA 7394), price-list/rate-card at counter &amp; online, and trade-pro/member pricing consistency (VS-13)
Responsible (R): Pricing / Compliance
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: At launch + review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5083_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5083_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5083_Task6" name="Link to analytics: feed cost-consumption (W5084), margin analytics (W5099)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Link to analytics: feed cost-consumption (W5084), margin analytics (W5099), competitive positioning, and promotions (VS-14)
Responsible (R): Pricing / Analytics / Marketing
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5083_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5083_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5083_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5083_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5083_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-758 (ensure controlled execution — Reprographics Service Strategy, Equipment &amp; Catalog Setup (PA-176.1).) | - CTL-758: pricing cost-based &amp; FP&amp;A-approved; RA 7394 all-in disclosure (VS-118); discounts margin-controlled
Owner: Pricing (VS-01.2) / Director Store Services</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5083_Assoc9" sourceRef="W5083_Annotation8" targetRef="W5083_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
