        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-101 (ensure reprographics IP &amp; file-handling control.) | - CTL-758: customer authorship attestation at intake; RA 8293/RA 10173 policy (Legal); sealed-bid protocol; secure disposal (W5100); staff trained (VS-19.4)
Owner: Legal/Compliance (VS-100/VS-22) / Director Store Services</bpmn:text>
