    <bpmn:process id="W_W5088" name="W5088. Equipment Maintenance, Vendor Service Contract &amp; Calibration Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PM cycle; equipment install (W5082); breakdown; calibration due
Frequency: Scheduled PM + reactive
Volume: ~all plotters/scanners across service sites
Owner: Facilities/IT (VS-138/VS-99) / Director Store Services
Participants: Facilities (VS-138), IT (VS-27/VS-99), Metrology/Calibration (VS-115), Vendor service, Store Services Lead
Source: workflow W5088 — Equipment Maintenance, Vendor Service Contract &amp; Calibration Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5088_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5088_Lane1" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5088_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5088_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5088_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5088_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5088_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5088_Start3" name="PM cycle; equipment install (W5082); breakdown; calibration due">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5088_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5088_Task4" name="Maintain the vendor service contract: plotter/scanner maintenance contract…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the vendor service contract: plotter/scanner maintenance contract, response-time SLA, parts supply, and contract management (links VS-03)
Responsible (R): Facilities / Procurement
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: Annual + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5088_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5088_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5088_Task5" name="Execute scheduled PM &amp; calibration: print-head cleaning, alignment, color/scale…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute scheduled PM &amp; calibration: print-head cleaning, alignment, color/scale calibration (VS-115), scanner accuracy, and the PM cycle on finishing equipment
Responsible (R): Facilities / Metrology / Vendor
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: Per PM cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5088_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5088_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5088_Task6" name="Manage reactive/breakdown: breakdown response, substitute capacity/3PL, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage reactive/breakdown: breakdown response, substitute capacity/3PL, and feed downtime analytics (W5098) + reliability improvement
Responsible (R): Facilities / IT / Director Store Services
Accountable (A): Director Store Services
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5088_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5088_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5088_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5088_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5088_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-758 (ensure controlled execution — Reprographics Service Strategy, Equipment &amp; Catalog Setup (PA-176.1).) | - CTL-758: vendor SLA in contract; PM schedule adherence (VS-138); calibration current (VS-115)
Owner: Facilities/IT (VS-138/VS-99) / Director Store Services</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
